Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What secrets hide beneath the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,emerald roof of the Amazon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From high above, the rainforest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,reveals a continuous canopy of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,towering trees, draped with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,epiphytes and tangled lianas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This green ceiling shelters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,between forty and seventy-five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,percent of the planet’s known
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,species, and scientists believe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,millions more remain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,undiscovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Because many plants yield
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,medicines, the forest has been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,called the world’s largest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,pharmacy, providing over a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,quarter of natural remedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Amazon rainforest, spanning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,over 670 million hectares, is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the largest terrestrial carbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,sink, playing a crucial role
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,in mitigating global warming by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,capturing up to 25% of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,global carbon dioxide emissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet the same canopy is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,under siege; slash-and-burn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,clearing during the dry season
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,sparks fires that surged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,dramatically in 2019, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.81,0:00:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,satellite data showing more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,80,000 fires across Brazil, a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,77% rise, darkening skies as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,far away as São Paulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The canopy’s health therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,matters to the whole planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,acting as a buffer against
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,global warming, and protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it preserves countless species,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,medicines, and the climate we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,all share.